{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "arpmenu",
 "version": "0.1",
 "title": "ARP MENU (long press)",
 "description": "A long press of the arpeggiator's on/off combo, FUNC + KEYBOARD, opens the ARP menu (what FUNC + SYN1 opens); a quick FUNC + KEYBOARD still turns the arp on and off, on its release. For the Digitone mk1 and Digitone Keys, OS 1.43 and 1.44 (it names no firmware address: its 1.44 port is empty). Needs core-dn1 5.0.1.",
 "category": "Utility",
 "author": "irpina",
